WEBVTT

1
00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:02.417
<i>For 2000 years, Britain has had
a long-standing tradition of coal mining.</i>

2
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.667
<i>But it was Sir George Bruce</i>

3
00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:08.708
<i>from Scotland
who changed the game in 1575.</i>

4
00:02:08.792 --> 00:02:11.184
<i>He came up with the brilliant idea
of connecting a 40-foot shaft</i>

5
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:12.958
<i>to two other shafts,</i>

6
00:02:13.042 --> 00:02:16.583
<i>making ventilation and water drainage
much more efficient in the mines.</i>

7
00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:19.708
<i>This innovative technique,
which originated in Britain,</i>

8
00:02:19.792 --> 00:02:23.042
<i>is still widely used in coal mines
all over the world today.</i>

9
00:02:23.292 --> 00:02:25.750
<i>India's first coal mine was established
in Raniganj</i>

10
00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:28.917
<i>by British pioneers
who worked for the East India Company,</i>

11
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.083
<i>John Sumner and Suetonius Grant Heatly.</i>

12
00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:34.875
<i>It's clear that the coal trade in India</i>

13
00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:37.250
<i>was influenced greatly
by the British system.</i>

14
00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:40.833
<i>Aspects such as Markatta quarters,
officers' clubs, mining definitions,</i>

15
00:02:40.917 --> 00:02:44.500
<i>and even the prestigious
Indian School of Mines in Dhanbad</i>

16
00:02:44.625 --> 00:02:48.250
<i>was modeled after
London's Royal Schools of Mines.</i>

17
00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:50.792
<i>Despite the vast distance
of 6000 kilometers</i>

18
00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:53.167
<i>separating the mines
in England and India,</i>

19
00:02:53.292 --> 00:02:55.500
<i>there was a common challenge they faced.</i>

20
00:02:55.583 --> 00:02:59.292
<i>Accidents within the mines.</i>

21
00:03:11.708 --> 00:03:15.958
TRAGEDY IN CHASNALA

22
00:03:16.042 --> 00:03:22.333
375 PEOPLE TRAPPED IN WATER AND RUBBLE

23
00:03:31.375 --> 00:03:32.375
Listen, mister.

24
00:03:32.958 --> 00:03:35.292
If you keep hiding in there,

25
00:03:35.375 --> 00:03:36.625
how will this matter be solved?

26
00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:38.417
Disperse the crowd first.

27
00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.583
They will behave like gentlemen.
Just open the door.

28
00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:44.875
No, I don't trust you.
Send the crowd back.

29
00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:45.958
Listen, mister!

30
00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.500
Nobody is leaving.

31
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:51.875
First, I want assurance that you will take
Nandu Malla back on the job.

32
00:03:52.292 --> 00:03:54.875
- It wasn't me. Jaswant fired him.
- Where is he?

33
00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.625
Hey, break down the door.

34
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:03.333
Come on.

35
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.476
Do you plan to break the door or what?

36
00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.333
- Don't call the police, mister.
- Yes.

37
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:13.235
You wouldn't listen to my requests, right?
Now you will see.

38
00:04:14.792 --> 00:04:16.250
Open or we will break it.

39
00:04:17.708 --> 00:04:19.875
It's still not too late. Open the door.

40
00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:26.958
- Break it.
- God, please save me.

41
00:04:27.042 --> 00:04:29.000
- Hit harder.
- Okay.

42
00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:30.958
Stop!

43
00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.042
Brother.

44
00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:38.728
He's the one
who was bossing me around.

45
00:04:48.792 --> 00:04:49.917
Brother, all good?

46
00:04:50.125 --> 00:04:51.667
- You…
- Sir, your wife's on the line.

47
00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.917
You fool!

48
00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:55.250
Is this the time to attend calls?

49
00:04:55.375 --> 00:04:58.500
Sorry, brother. It's my wife.
Let me answer the call, please.

50
00:04:58.583 --> 00:04:59.625
I'm sure you understand.

51
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.708
Hello, Nirdosh.

52
00:05:01.958 --> 00:05:02.958
<i>Jaswant.</i>

53
00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.292
What's taking you so long?

54
00:05:04.625 --> 00:05:05.917
I've been waiting for so long.

55
00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:07.542
Do you know what the time is?

56
00:05:07.625 --> 00:05:08.708
I know it's 6:00 p.m.

57
00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:10.750
My senior officer is here.

58
00:05:10.875 --> 00:05:12.676
To ensure he doesn't make
any wrong decisions,

59
00:05:12.708 --> 00:05:15.208
I had to come back to the office.

60
00:05:15.292 --> 00:05:17.458
Have you thought of a gift
to take to the wedding?

61
00:05:17.542 --> 00:05:18.702
Do you have anything in mind?

62
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.250
Dinner set?

63
00:05:20.375 --> 00:05:22.292
- Mr. Gupta is already giving it.
<i>- Really?</i>

64
00:05:22.458 --> 00:05:23.667
How about a mixer grinder?

65
00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.750
But isn't the boss gifting that?

66
00:05:26.042 --> 00:05:27.208
The boss is giving that.

67
00:05:27.792 --> 00:05:29.000
<i>So then what should we give?</i>

68
00:05:30.458 --> 00:05:32.792
Anyway, you don't worry.

69
00:05:33.167 --> 00:05:35.542
I will speak to my senior,

70
00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:37.625
resolve the matter, and come home.

71
00:05:38.625 --> 00:05:39.625
Alright.

72
00:05:40.292 --> 00:05:42.625
Why did you fire Nandu?

73
00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:45.250
Yes, because he was drunk on duty.

74
00:05:45.375 --> 00:05:46.458
Take him back.

75
00:05:46.792 --> 00:05:48.125
Nandu, apologize to him.

76
00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:50.833
Forgive me.

77
00:05:51.458 --> 00:05:52.458
Okay, you're forgiven.

78
00:05:52.625 --> 00:05:54.083
- But he can't resume work.
- Why?

79
00:05:54.167 --> 00:05:57.292
- Hey, do you know me?
- No.

80
00:05:57.583 --> 00:05:59.792
- You idiot!
- You…

81
00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:10.833
I'm sorry. I guess I hit too hard.

82
00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:12.792
But it is your fault.

83
00:06:12.875 --> 00:06:14.059
How could you aim at my turban?

84
00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:17.875
- Aim at my chest if you want.
- My gun!

85
00:06:17.958 --> 00:06:19.750
- What you did was wrong.
- Correct.

86
00:06:20.417 --> 00:06:24.792
But on the call with your wife,

87
00:06:25.125 --> 00:06:26.500
you addressed me as your senior.

88
00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:30.542
For that respect, I forgive you.

89
00:06:30.958 --> 00:06:31.833
Thank you.

90
00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:33.000
- But, brother...
- Quiet!

91
00:06:33.917 --> 00:06:35.583
Idiot! How dare you drink on duty!

92
00:06:35.792 --> 00:06:37.792
Moron! Get out!

93
00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.583
Let's go. Come on.

94
00:06:39.792 --> 00:06:42.000
- Brother, are you okay?
- It's okay. I'm fine.

95
00:06:42.292 --> 00:06:43.292
Let's go.

96
00:06:45.458 --> 00:06:47.708
Come with me.
I'll show you.

97
00:06:47.792 --> 00:06:49.152
- Quiet!
- But at least listen to me.

98
00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:55.000
- Sir.?
- Yes.

99
00:06:55.375 --> 00:06:56.375
Jaswant here.

100
00:06:56.542 --> 00:06:57.542
They are gone, sir.

101
00:06:58.333 --> 00:06:59.583
Open the door, sir.

102
00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.000
Good day, sir.

103
00:07:05.917 --> 00:07:06.792
- Greetings, sir.
- Greetings.

104
00:07:06.875 --> 00:07:09.417
Have you solved everyone's problems?

105
00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.833
What are you doing, Nirdosh?

106
00:07:12.042 --> 00:07:13.500
You're pregnant, right?

107
00:07:13.583 --> 00:07:14.768
Remember what the doctor said?

108
00:07:14.792 --> 00:07:17.250
- Take it easy.
- There is nothing to worry about.

109
00:07:17.333 --> 00:07:18.458
Doctors only scare us.

110
00:07:18.542 --> 00:07:20.625
Nobody can win an argument with you.
Come on.

111
00:07:21.667 --> 00:07:23.458
Nirdosh, I have to say…

112
00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:25.250
you look beautiful.

113
00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:26.750
Don't start again.

114
00:07:27.792 --> 00:07:30.417
Do we have to attend this wedding?

115
00:07:31.292 --> 00:07:33.000
It's from your side of the family.

116
00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.667
- You decide.
- Oh, yes, I forgot.

117
00:07:36.583 --> 00:07:38.000
Well, let's go.

118
00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:39.833
Like this?

119
00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.000
Go and change.

120
00:07:41.292 --> 00:07:42.292
What's the point?

121
00:07:42.375 --> 00:07:45.292
All eyes are going to be on you, not me.

122
00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:48.417
Not again. Go get dressed.

123
00:07:53.292 --> 00:07:54.333
Go on.

